<title>MALAYSIA: IGB, NBT shares suspended.</title>
<headline>IGB, NBT shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of IGB Corp Bhd and North Borneo Timbers Bhd (NBT) were suspended on Wednesday pending announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Property developer IGB stock closed at 2.93 ringgit on Tuesday, while shares of NBT, which is involved in cocoa and oil palm cultivation and reforestation, were last traded at 8.70 ringgit.</p>
<p>Officials of both companies could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
